Subject: [PATCH 46/78] SystemUI: Add QS tile layout settings [1/2]

* Updated for A16 QS Refactor + Split shade layout.
* Renamed settings since we want to reset this for A15 -> A16 upgrade users.

This was originally based on work by maxwen for OmniRom

Ref:
https://github.com/omnirom/android_frameworks_base_old/commit/ad6124ad13a3c04f1b7d5d136c054b2e0062b9dd
https://github.com/omnirom/android_frameworks_base_old/commit/b4d26258e3cc301aac9492a316fc5fd196aa1c8e

However, the same has been refined over years and completely changed. Below is the change history.

Squashed:
